<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54858" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταπνέω</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατα-πνείω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>blow</i> or <i>breathe upon</i>
			or <i>over</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί τινος, Χώρας</span>
			(Reisk. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χώραν</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> καταπνεῦσαι ἡδυπνόους αὔρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Med.</u>
					839
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἔρως ἵμερον κ. ἡμῶν κατὰ τῶν
					κόλπων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					552
				</span></i>
			: with gen. understood, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				541a29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				594b27
			</span></i>: also c. acc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τόπον εὐωδίᾳ</span>
			<i>fill</i> the place with fragrance, <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				3.2
			</span></i>: c. acc. cogn., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδὺ κ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Cer.</u>
				238
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπινθὴρ -πνευσθείς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.455
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πνευσθέντες ὑπὸ ἀνέμων ψυχρῶν</span>
			<i>blown upon</i> by . . , <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.599
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατόπεδον οὐ -πνεόμενον ἐκ τῆς
					θαλάσσης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>Pun.</u>
					99
				</span></i>
			: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅταν Βορρᾶς -πνεύσῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cratin.
					207
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>inspire</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεόθεν καταπνείει πειθὼ . . ξύμφυτος
					αἰών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					105
				</span></i>
			 (s. v.l., lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοῦ ὁμόνοιαν,
				ὀργὴν δικαίαν -πνέοντος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				12.2
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				7
			</span></i>: c. acc. pers., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεὸς καταπνεῖ σε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					387
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πνευσθείς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.411
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>blow upon</i>, c. dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς πρὸς ἄρκτον οἰκοῦσι . . κ. ὁ
					νότος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					945a36
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μή σοι νέμεσις θεόθεν καταπνεύσῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
				</span></i>
			 Com.<i><span class="en">
				173.14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be blown up</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλόξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.474d
				</span></i>
			.</div>
